						<r3d:remarks>World Data Center for Oceanography, Obninsk is regular WDS Member.
Three WDCs in Russia carry out the activity, being a part of the All-Russian Research Institute of Hydrometeorological Information - World Data Center (RIHMI-WDC). All these Centers are situated in Obninsk: WDC for Meteorology, WDC for Oceanography, WDC for Rockets, Satellites and Rotation of the Earth</r3d:remarks>
